    opts:["Mean and variance of ln(X)","Mean and variance of X directly","The shape and scale parameters","Location and rate parameters"],
    ans:0, exp:"μ = E[ln(X)] and σ² = Var[ln(X)]. They are NOT the mean and variance of X itself." },

  // ── BETA DISTRIBUTION (Q93–Q100) ──
  { topic:"Beta", tc:"tc-beta",
